    MC "(Merda... E agora?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:15
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_e54d0a8a:

    # "Regina did her best to force a smile as Officer Lukkan stepped inside with four guards."
    "Regina fez o possível para forçar um sorriso enquanto o Oficial Lukkan entrava com quatro guardas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:16
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_76f19062:

    # REGINA @ talk "Is there something we can help you with, Officer?"
    REGINA @ talk "Há algo em que possamos ajudá-lo, Oficial?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:17
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_928ed16d:

    # "Lukkan did not even acknowledge [regina_ref!t], instead, he focused only on me."
    "Lukkan nem sequer reconheceu [regina_ref!t], em vez disso, focou apenas em mim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:18
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_672dd8f8:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "It's your lucky day."
    LUKKAN @ talk "É o seu dia de sorte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:19
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_229e756d:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "You and your friend have been given a new assignment coming straight from Emperor Alcott himself."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Você e sua amiga receberam uma nova missão vinda diretamente do próprio Imperador Alcott."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:20
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_65fcd07c:

    # MC @ surprised "The... The Emperor?"
    MC @ surprised "O... O Imperador?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:21
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_296e04cf:

    # "Regina kept glancing back from me to Lukkan, and despite the pained smile on her face, I could tell she was wondering what in the seven hells I had done to cause this."
    "Regina não parava de olhar de mim para Lukkan, e apesar do sorriso dolorido em seu rosto, eu percebi que ela estava se perguntando o que nos sete infernos eu tinha feito para causar isso."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:22
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_86a9f347:

    # REGINA @ talk "Haha, there must be some mistake, Officer."
    REGINA @ talk "Haha, deve haver algum engano, Oficial."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:23
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_650a28c5:

    # REGINA talk "[player_name!t] no longer works within the Scouts Corps, so-"
    REGINA talk "[player_name!t] não trabalha mais no Corpo de Escoteiros, então-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:24
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_762430b6:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "There is no mistake."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Não há engano algum."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:25
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_c96b5ca9:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "...Tell the woman to leave."
    LUKKAN @ talk "...Diga à mulher para sair."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:26
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_958641ea:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "This next part is for your ears only."
    LUKKAN @ talk "O que vem a seguir é apenas para seus ouvidos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:27
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_0fc76051:

    # "[regina_ref_cap!t] gritted her teeth in anger."
    "[regina_ref_cap!t] rangeu os dentes de raiva."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:28
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_7900c5d3:

    # REGINA @ angry "Who do you think you're talking-"
    REGINA @ angry "Com quem você pensa que está falando-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:29
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_529af1e1:

    # MC @ serious "[regina_ref_cap!t], it's okay."
    MC @ serious "[regina_ref_cap!t], está tudo bem."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:30
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_4efe450a:

    # REGINA @ sad "But-"
    REGINA @ sad "Mas-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:31
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_7a8a8244:

    # MC @ talk "[regina_ref_cap!t]... You should go."
    MC @ talk "[regina_ref_cap!t]... Deverias ir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:32
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_9e4170c3:

    # "On the tip of her tongue, [regina_ref!t] held back from saying something else."
    "Na ponta da língua, [regina_ref!t] conteve-se de dizer algo mais."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:33
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_9c30313d:

    # "She glanced over at the guards and Lukkan, there was something deadly serious about them, and we could both sense it."
    "Ela olhou de relance para os guardas e Lukkan; havia algo de mortalmente sério neles, e nós dois podíamos senti-lo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:34
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_91f1d89f:

    # "After a brief sigh, she recomposed herself."
    "Após um breve suspiro, ela recompôs-se."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:35
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_9f19bc15:

    # REGINA @ talk "I will be back shortly."
    REGINA @ talk "Voltarei em breve."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:37
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_1cf00936:

    # "The guards allowed [regina_ref!t] to pass, and waited till the door was closed behind her."
    "Os guardas permitiram que [regina_ref!t] passasse, e esperaram até que a porta se fechasse atrás dela."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:41
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_eee57c00:

    # MC @ talk "Now what is this about?"
    MC @ talk "Agora, do que se trata isto?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:42
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_2e648af0:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "To the South of here, we've noticed considerable Demorai movement over the last few days."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Ao sul daqui, notámos um movimento considerável dos Demorai nos últimos dias."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:43
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_7b5785a2:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "They've also been acting... {i}strangely,{/i} recently."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Eles também têm agido... {i}estranhamente,{/i} ultimamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:44
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_d74c10b7:

    # MC @ think "{i}Strangely?{/i}"
    MC @ think "{i}Estranhamente?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:45
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_a9a5f220:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Keeping their distance... Watching troops move but not attacking."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Mantendo distância... Observando as tropas se moverem, mas sem atacar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:46
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_82a65454:

    # MC @ talk "Maybe they're just scouting?"
    MC @ talk "Talvez estejam apenas fazendo reconhecimento?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:47
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_ada16c97:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Maybe, but it's not like them to avoid ambushes or a fight, and they to be more focused on getting somewhere."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Talvez, mas não é típico deles evitar emboscadas ou lutas, e parecem estar mais focados em chegar a algum lugar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:48
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_0a4161b9:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "We want you to find out what's going on out there."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Queremos que você descubra o que está acontecendo lá fora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:53
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_8982004f:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "What? Did you seriously think we'd just let you fuck around in the Adventurers Guild forever?"
    LUKKAN @ talk "O quê? Você achou mesmo que deixaríamos você vagabundear na Guilda dos Aventureiros para sempre?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:54
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_3e037774:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "No no no no... That's not how this works."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Não, não, não, não... Não é assim que funciona."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:55
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_706e47d4:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "We decide how you live and how you die."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Nós decidimos como você vive e como você morre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:56
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_43e27c4f:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "If you prove yourself useful, maybe we decide today's not the day you die."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Se você se mostrar útil, talvez decidamos que hoje não é o dia em que você morre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:59
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_eaa75517:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Urghh... Why does every prick who joins the Adventurers Guild think there's some 'special' reason they get picked?"
    LUKKAN @ talk "Urghh... Por que todo idiota que entra na Guilda dos Aventureiros acha que há algum motivo 'especial' para ser escolhido?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:60
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_2e8a87d3:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Maybe the Emperor wants to see what you and your friend can do."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Talvez o Imperador queira ver o que você e seu amigo podem fazer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:61
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_390c9829:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Maybe he just picked your name up at random from a list."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Talvez ele só tenha pegado seu nome aleatoriamente de uma lista."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:62
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_02ccdf81:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Maybe some high lord just really wants to fuck that woman of yours and wants you out of the way."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Talvez algum alto lorde só queira muito foder aquela sua mulher e te tirar do caminho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:63
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_dd0d824f:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "What does it matter in the end?"
    LUKKAN @ talk "O que isso importa no final?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:64
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_edfef6f8:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Doesn't change a goddamn thing."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Não muda porra nenhuma."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:67
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_2672a36d:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Anymore inane questions?"
    LUKKAN @ talk "Mais alguma pergunta idiota?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:73
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_070a6a8c:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "That would be a {i}very{/i} fucking stupid decision."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Essa seria uma decisão {i}muito{/i} estúpida pra caralho."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:74
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_bcc527f1:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Simply put, not only would {i}you{/i} be punished, but the people you care most for would be punished as well."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Simplificando, não apenas {i}você{/i} seria punido, mas as pessoas de quem você mais gosta também seriam punidas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:75
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_21cf589d:

    # MC @ talk "Was that a threat?"
    MC @ talk "Isso foi uma ameaça?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:76
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_07f5e75a:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Take it however you want."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Entenda como quiser."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:77
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_07b1e39e:

    # MC "(Looks like {i}no{/i} isn't going to be an answer here.)"
    MC "(Parece que {i}não{/i} não vai ser uma resposta aqui.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:79
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_07c62d5e:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Excellent!"
    LUKKAN @ talk "Excelente!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:80
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_3fcc19a4:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "See? You're learning fast already!"
    LUKKAN @ talk "Viu? Já está aprendendo rápido!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:81
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_11a44960:

    # MC @ angry "Am I at least getting paid for this?"
    MC @ angry "Pelo menos vou ser pago por isso?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:82
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_f5005351:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "The Emperor always pays graciously for services rendered."
    LUKKAN @ talk "O Imperador sempre paga generosamente pelos serviços prestados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:83
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu1_3b5df5d2:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Five hundred coins."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Quinhentas moedas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:88
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_caf872b4:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Confident little fucker, aren't you?"
    LUKKAN @ talk "Filho da puta confiante, não é?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:89
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_98ecb738:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Fine... Seven hundred coins and not one more."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Tudo bem... Setecentas moedas e nem uma a mais."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:94
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_eba11e72:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Fine, there you go."
    LUKKAN @ talk "{i}*Suspiro*{/i} Tudo bem, aqui está."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:97
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_d4ef1be7:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Now, let's move on..."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Agora, vamos prosseguir..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:103
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_e08c2e72:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "That depends."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Isso depende."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:104
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_9c5f1602:

    # MC @ angry "On?"
    MC @ angry "Em?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:105
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_b80c1a14:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "If you survive and if we decide we need you again."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Se você sobreviver e se decidirmos que precisamos de você novamente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:106
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_6e8391e8:

    # MC @ angry "...Great."
    MC @ angry "...Ótimo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:107
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_dd963660:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Lighten up kid, you're hardly the first person to get fucked by higher ups."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Relaxa, garoto, você dificilmente é o primeiro a ser fodido pelos superiores."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:108
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_e5eb476c:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Now, moving on..."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Agora, seguindo em frente..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:110
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_a0e2c92b:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "I'll mark on your map for you where we last saw some of the Demorai moving."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Vou marcar no seu mapa onde vimos pela última vez alguns Demorai se movendo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:111
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_d5898815:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Your friend should be waiting for you outside the gate."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Seu amigo deve estar esperando por você do lado de fora do portão."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:112
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_c53e42a1:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Meet him there and report back to me when you've found something."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Encontre-o lá e me informe quando encontrar algo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:113
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_d82fd61a:

    # "I gritted my teeth and swallowed my pride as I answered him."
    "Rangei os dentes e engoli o orgulho enquanto lhe respondia."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:114
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_ad0310f2:

    # MC @ angry "...Yes sir."
    MC @ angry "...Sim senhor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:115
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_e76b14c3:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Don't fail us."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Não nos decepcione."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:117
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_f28c70cf:

    # "Lukkan said nothing else, turning and leaving with his men the way he came."
    "Lukkan não disse mais nada, virou-se e foi embora com seus homens pelo mesmo caminho por onde veio."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:118
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_65742bf3:

    # "I sighed with relief once he left, feeling that heel pressed against my throat lift ever so slightly."
    "Soltei um suspiro de alívio quando ele partiu, sentindo aquele calcanhar pressionado contra minha garganta aliviar-se um pouco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:119
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_d40eb3e9:

    # MC "(Fuck... Are they just going to keep sending me and Markus on missions till we eventually die?)"
    MC "(Droga... Será que eles vão continuar me enviando e ao Markus em missões até que a gente morra de vez?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:120
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_c78e8b30:

    # MC "(This can't go on forever, one of these missions...)"
    MC "(Isso não pode continuar para sempre, uma dessas missões...)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:121
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_fa90da0f:

    # "The thought of the Man in Black crossed my mind once again, what if he or someone like him was waiting for me?"
    "O pensamento do Homem de Preto passou pela minha mente mais uma vez: e se ele ou alguém como ele estivesse me esperando?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:122
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_d30a83f3:

    # "I pushed the thought aside and swallowed hard."
    "Afastei o pensamento e engoli em seco."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:123
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_acfd1072:

    # "It doesn't matter now."
    "Não importa agora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:124
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_e9cff2df:

    # "I need to focus on the mission ahead and meet with Markus."
    "Preciso me concentrar na missão à frente e me encontrar com Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_0.rpy:125
translate ptPT qst_TwoEmperors_0_menu2_a55fb10e:

    # "...Not like there was any other choice in the matter."
    "...Não que houvesse outra escolha na questão."

